{"id":51643,"date":"2026-06-14T06:55:04","date_gmt":"2026-06-14T05:55:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/nature-race-farmacia-dos-alamos\/"},"modified":"2026-09-19T19:53:16","modified_gmt":"2026-09-19T18:53:16","slug":"nature-race-farmacia-dos-alamos","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/nature-race-farmacia-dos-alamos\/","title":{"rendered":"Nature Race Farm\u00e1cia dos \u00c1lamos 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Nature Race Farm\u00e1cia dos \u00c1lamos 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Nature Race Farm\u00e1cia dos \u00c1lamos 2026<\/strong> (4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>20 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong>, na encantadora vila de <strong>Nossa Senhora de Machede<\/strong>, concelho e distrito de <strong>\u00c9vora<\/strong>. Organizada com dedica\u00e7\u00e3o pelo <strong>CNE \u2013 Agrupamento 890<\/strong> com o patroc\u00ednio da <strong>Farm\u00e1cia dos \u00c1lamos<\/strong> e apoio do Munic\u00edpio de \u00c9vora, o evento celebra o desporto ao ar livre e a comunh\u00e3o com a natureza alentejana.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e partidas na <strong>Zona Desportiva \/ Recinto de Festas<\/strong> de Nossa Senhora de Machede, a jornada desportiva acolhe o <strong>Trail de 18 km (+400m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s 09:00, o <strong>Mini Trail de 12 km (+200m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s 09:15, a <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 09:20 e a <strong>Corrida Kids de 1 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 10:30. Os percursos serpentear\u00e3o por veredas de montado de sobro e azinho, caminhos agr\u00edcolas e plan\u00edcies douradas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 de Setembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"disp